# Every package's `format` script loads this file explicitly with --ignore-path,
# because Prettier only auto-discovers a .prettierignore in its own CWD and never
# walks up to the workspace root. Keep patterns `**/`-anchored so they match the
# same way whether Prettier runs from here or from a package directory.

**/package-lock.json
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/yarn.lock
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/routeTree.gen.ts
**/.kysely-codegenrc.json
**/modules/data/db.ts

# Prose, wrapped by hand and argued over line by line. Prettier reflows it and
# rewrites its tables, so a one-paragraph edit to a decision doc arrives as a
# hundred lines of churn over text nobody touched. None of it has ever been
# formatted — `--check` fails on files that have been correct for months — so
# this records the existing state rather than changing anything.
**/docs/
